{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0513_1000_p", "source_sha256": "7973000961b0b2962b65eff7ebaebbbd3ee3558b8b6848c41867fc2d0e34b747", "ja": "（いよいよ魔法学園のドラマ撮影が始まる。\n今から、千鶴さんの衣装の最終確認なんだけど……）", "zh": "（魔法学园电视剧的拍摄终于要开始了。现在要最后确认千鹤小姐的服装，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0513_1001_038chz", "source_sha256": "d3bcd07b2b17b2296e549dfa36a20b68a448a383abd68bd2c864e478c3442200", "ja": "はぁ……。", "zh": "喔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0513_1002_p", "source_sha256": "71ee5fc29ae0f323b0f51a5dc2931f632e3c88dd76726705fd41d7ce5ab5aa9a", "ja": "千鶴さん、どうかしましたか？\n何か悩みでも……。", "zh": "千鹤小姐，怎么了吗？  \n是有什么烦恼吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0513_1003_038chz", "source_sha256": "7440ce3a60aaf6c987259ee13685ef64266088330af07cc380713e107614e52e", "ja": "{$P$}……ええ。\n実は、演技のことですこし悩んでいて。", "zh": "{$P$}……嗯。\n其实，我对演技有点烦恼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0513_1004_038chz", "source_sha256": "8cb73a54e746aa343c0783da2d2e7c49d26c0f2059ff10cd123254ee2741c31e", "ja": "できれば、相談に乗っていただきたいのですが……\n今、時間はありまして？", "zh": "如果可以的话，想请您帮我参谋一下……您现在有时间吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0513_1005_p", "source_sha256": "477ef59867b250147361d8d93e958321f8d5d3422f3215de2cb94d17510fc4c4", "ja": "もちろんです！　けど、意外ですね。\n千鶴さんは前作からバッチリだったのに、悩みなんて。", "zh": "当然可以！不过，真让人意外呢。\n千鹤在上部作品里就表现得那么出色，居然也会有烦恼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0513_1006_038chz", "source_sha256": "f6823d22d54d2000d46e4d359e688bbfab2fc95319a6010c731299f87cac950d", "ja": "まあ、ありがとうございます。\nですが今回は、星梨花と諍いがありますから。", "zh": "哎呀，谢谢您。不过这次和星梨花发生了争执。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0513_1007_038chz", "source_sha256": "366c6329cc28da2610a30a615d825a0590b0f17a53c3ed736cfa7bbce1a2d8ef", "ja": "作中の千鶴は、星梨花のためを思って行動しても、\n上手く伝えられないもどかしさを抱えていますわ。", "zh": "剧中的千鹤即使是为星梨花着想而行动，也抱有无法顺利传达心意的苦恼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0513_1008_038chz", "source_sha256": "3b92f2e2dc381e4a33e9be1aaf8cffa99b0ef252ff8b6870e5ad2f6a3e8e21f1", "ja": "{$P$}には、そうした経験は\nありまして？　参考のため聞かせてくださいまし。", "zh": "{$P$}，您有过类似的经历吗？\n可否说给我听听，以供参考呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0513_1009_p", "source_sha256": "750a1e27e2d98852ccd86f297b8090aed2573ed970640f9e417c42321263da96", "ja": "そうですね……。改めて考えてみると、そんな事ばかり\nなのかもしれません。プロデューサーという職業は……", "zh": "是啊……重新想想，或许制作人的工作就是尽是这种事吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0513_1010_p", "source_sha256": "0577cfbd2dc1de8635b613f5de50d83cf25822f48ae51c39e3148a918d9d7e1d", "ja": "営業で、担当アイドルの魅力を伝えきれなかったり。\nファンの皆のために考えた企画のウケが悪かったり。", "zh": "比如在跑业务时，没能充分传达负责偶像的魅力。\n或是为粉丝们策划的企划反响并不好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0513_1011_038chz", "source_sha256": "ba76011c8302f8a6ed87c5a15c99d497dcb27dec57d75b30c476d87404b5bdb0", "ja": "あら……{$P$}ほどの方でも、\nそういった悩みがあるんですのね。", "zh": "啊……原来连{$P$}这样的人，也会有这种烦恼啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0513_1012_p", "source_sha256": "80d1b0a77a1c42f67dc7077b91f16dce5daf2b03328908b27baa8f2ff293576d", "ja": "ええ。もっと大勢の人に、アイドル達を知ってほしい。\nファンの皆に、もっと喜んでほしい……。", "zh": "是的。我希望能让更多人了解偶像们。\n也希望粉丝们能更加开心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0513_1013_p", "source_sha256": "b9686a917d6e89c562e7e27fa775ed9cca05f4cfd7c1a25d6ef8621677f334cb", "ja": "良かれと思って、『もっと』を考えて……\nだからこそ、もどかしくなるんでしょうね。", "zh": "正因为是出于好意，想着要‘更多’……所以才会觉得着急和无奈吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0513_1014_038chz", "source_sha256": "1d7735c62de53de18d485a79e2a2ac79156e119d32221c39065193adb9dfb70f", "ja": "ふむ……。そういうことであれば、\nアイドルも同じかもしれませんわね。", "zh": "嗯……如果是这样的话，偶像或许也是一样的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0513_1015_p", "source_sha256": "2341abe21d7d3b3b378c66c78c7198939290635d8d977042b19662a2dd05b6ab", "ja": "そうですか？", "zh": "是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0513_1016_038chz", "source_sha256": "9fd09de943b8f0037e351de01e6cbac718541b0c2a20f132184d9c6af723d052", "ja": "ええ。ファンのみなさまに喜んでほしいのは、\nわたくしも同じですし……。", "zh": "是的。我也希望各位粉丝能够开心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0513_1017_038chz", "source_sha256": "1fbcc599e5982e5d29a6bab165da3e5f8563daf1eaa58375919ad0f7e25a0683", "ja": "自分を見出してくれた{$P$}の\n期待に、上手く応えたいと常々思っていますわ。", "zh": "我一直都希望能好好回应发掘出我的{$P$}的期待。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0513_1018_p", "source_sha256": "57d54410f2ea8e1581615eb34ccf0f37484cf0c4dbb09f2c38fb889474b6eda8", "ja": "千鶴さん……。", "zh": "千鹤小姐……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0513_1019_038chz", "source_sha256": "bc25a04efb8dd8b5a768da314c1d53b9d46c7edfc2f8bb501c7edd004d292ffe", "ja": "ふふ。大丈夫ですわ、{$P$}。皆に\n恩返ししたい気持ちは、わたくしにもありますもの。", "zh": "呵呵。没关系，{$P$}。我也有想要报答大家的心情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0513_1020_038chz", "source_sha256": "c5113dc1985741e50b849631924a7f98931120a69a5a0f5bdc238b850a2bcf8a", "ja": "……お芝居の方向性、すこし掴めた気がしますわ。\nありがとうございます、{$P$}。", "zh": "……我好像稍微抓到这个戏剧的方向了。\n谢谢您，{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0513_1021_038chz", "source_sha256": "d7b68c9a55e4ef60c64f9c997d7a6071f8a105bbea5f14c7fd5d7d5f6bbc2d26", "ja": "わたくしに、全てお任せくださいまし！\n最高の魔法使いを、演じてみせますわよ！", "zh": "请把一切都交给我吧！\n我一定会演好最棒的魔法师！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0513_1022_038chz", "source_sha256": "1b478ee155178b4c24028336ab7378339c15bfb56acc98a50355a008b0813c12", "ja": "おーっほっほっほっほっ、ゲホッ、ゴホッ！", "zh": "哦——呵呵呵呵呵，咳、咳咳！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0513_1023_p", "source_sha256": "7c69a980cf90d24d0768b6ba2d629d9d9303e96be886797a2974f7f94f41ef2b", "ja": "（参考になったなら何よりだ。今回のドラマで、更に\n千鶴さんや皆を好きになってもらえるといいな……！）", "zh": "（只要能帮上忙就好。这次的电视剧，真希望能让大家更加喜欢千鹤小姐和其他人……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
